{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:17-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["pl"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Prosz\u0119 u\u017cy\u0107 klawisza backspace, aby usun\u0105\u0107."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Klawisze strza\u0142ek w lewo, w g\u00f3r\u0119 i w d\u00f3\u0142 s\u0105 wy\u0142\u0105czone. Tak samo klawisze home, end, pgup i pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["U\u017cyj backspace, aby usun\u0105\u0107."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Je\u017celi warto\u015b\u0107 jest wybrana, wystarczy zacz\u0105\u0107 wpisywa\u0107 now\u0105 warto\u015b\u0107, aby wyczy\u015bci\u0107 poprzedni\u0105."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Gdy wybrana jest liczba (warto\u015b\u0107 pokazana odwrotnie), u\u017cyj klawisza strza\u0142ki w prawo, aby usun\u0105\u0107 zaznaczenie bez usuwania warto\u015bci. Nast\u0119pnie backspace, aby edytowa\u0107."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["WSKAZ\u00d3WKA: Og\u00f3lnie rzecz bior\u0105c, najlepiej jest u\u017cywa\u0107 klawiszy TAB lub SHIFT-TAB do przechodzenia z jednego wej\u015bcia do nast\u0119pnego lub poprzedniego."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["PORADA 2: Og\u00f3lnie rzecz bior\u0105c, edycja warto\u015bci jest nieefektywna. Poniewa\u017c warto\u015bci s\u0105 automatycznie wybierane, po prostu wpisz liczb\u0119, kt\u00f3r\u0105 chcesz."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Nie nale\u017cy wpisywa\u0107 znaku separatora tysi\u0119cy."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Je\u015bli u\u017cywasz konwencji ameryka\u0144skiej, b\u0119dzie to przecinek.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Jestem na tyle sprytny, \u017ce wprowadz\u0119 je za Ciebie!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Wyst\u0105pi\u0142 nieznany b\u0142\u0105d obliczania daty."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Prosz\u0119 poda\u0107 nam swoje dane wej\u015bciowe i ustawienia, aby\u015bmy mogli to naprawi\u0107. Dzi\u0119kuj\u0119."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Data jest nieprawid\u0142owa - z\u0142y rok."],"Jan":["Sty"],"Feb":["Lut"],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Kwi"],"May":["Maj"],"Jun":["Cze"],"Jul":["Lip"],"Aug":["Sie"],"Sept":["Wrz"],"Oct":["Pa\u017a"],"Nov":["Lis"],"Dec":["Gru"],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["B\u0142\u0105d: daty poza kolejno\u015bci\u0105."],"Exception":["Wyj\u0105tek"],"occurred when accessing":["wyst\u0105pi\u0142 podczas dost\u0119pu do"],"Invalid index":["Nieprawid\u0142owy indeks"],"Unknown":["Nieznany"],"u":["n"],"U":["N"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["Osi\u0105gni\u0119to limit wewn\u0119trzny. Saldo przekracza +\/- 99 trylion\u00f3w."],"YTD":["YTD"],"Running Totals":["Bie\u017c\u0105ce sumy"],"Normal":["Standardowy"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["Tw\u00f3j indywidualny harmonogram kredytu"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["Kwota ostatniej raty pomniejszona o"],"due to rounding":["z powodu zaokr\u0105gle\u0144"],"Last payment amount increased by":["Kwota ostatniej p\u0142atno\u015bci zwi\u0119kszona o"],"Loan Summary":["Podsumowanie kredytu"],"Loan Amount":["Kwota kredytu"],"Number of Payments":["Liczba p\u0142atno\u015bci"],"Annual Interest Rate":["Roczna stopa procentowa"],"Periodic Payment":["P\u0142atno\u015b\u0107 okresowa"],"Loan Date":["Data kredytu"],"1st Payment Due":["Pierwsza rata nale\u017cna"],"Payment Frequency":["Cz\u0119stotliwo\u015b\u0107 p\u0142atno\u015bci"],"Last Payment Due":["Termin ostatniej raty"],"Total Interest Due":["Odsetki nale\u017cne og\u00f3\u0142em"],"Total All Payments":["Suma wszystkich rat"],"Payment Schedule":["Harmonogram sp\u0142aty"],"Year":["Rok"],"Date":["Data"],"Payment":["Rata"],"Interest":["Odsetki"],"Principal":["Kapita\u0142"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Calculation method: Normal":["Metoda obliczania: Standardowa"],"Total Principal":["Kapita\u0142 og\u00f3\u0142em"],"Total Interest":["Odsetki og\u00f3\u0142em"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["Procent ca\u0142kowitych p\u0142atno\u015bci"],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["Roczne sumy kapita\u0142u i odsetek"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Skumulowany kapita\u0142 i odsetki z pozosta\u0142ym saldem"],"Total Principal and Interest":["Kapita\u0142 i odsetki og\u00f3\u0142em"],"Loan":["Kredyt"],"There are too many unknown values.":["Istnieje zbyt wiele nieznanych warto\u015bci."],"Enter \"Loan Amount\", \"Number of Payments\" and \"Annual Interest Rate\".":["Wprowad\u017a \"kwot\u0119 kredytu\", \"liczb\u0119 rat\" i \"roczn\u0105 stop\u0119 procentow\u0105\"."],"<strong>Loan Calculator Help...<\/strong>":["<strong>Pomoc do kalkulatora kredytowego...<\/strong>"],"<p>Using the calculator is straightforward. User enters a &quot;loan amount&quot;, &quot;number of months&quot;, &quot;annual interest rate&quot;. The calculator calculates the monthly payment amount.<\/p>":["<p>Korzystanie z kalkulatora jest proste. U\u017cytkownik wprowadza \u201ekwot\u0119 kredytu\u201d, \u201eliczb\u0119 miesi\u0119cy\u201d, \u201eroczn\u0105 stop\u0119 procentow\u0105\u201d. Kalkulator oblicza miesi\u0119czn\u0105 rat\u0119.<\/p>"],"<p>The &quot;Payment Method&quot; determines when the first payment is due. With the default selection, &quot;End-of-Period&quot;, the first payment will be due one month after the loan is made. If &quot;Start-of-Period&quot; is selected, then the first payment will be due on the loan date.<\/p>":["<p>\u201eCzas p\u0142atno\u015bci\u201d okre\u015bla, kiedy przypada pierwsza rata. Przy domy\u015blnym wyborze \u201eKoniec okresu\u201d pierwsza rata b\u0119dzie wymagalna miesi\u0105c po udzieleniu kredytu. Je\u015bli wybrano \u201ePocz\u0105tek okresu\u201d, pierwsza rata b\u0119dzie wymagalna w dniu udzielenia kredytu.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">Okres kredytu wyra\u017cony jest w liczbie miesi\u0119cy.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 miesi\u0119cy = &nbsp;5 lat<\/li><li>120 miesi\u0119cy = 10 lat<\/li><li>180 miesi\u0119cy = 15 lat<\/li><li>240 miesi\u0119cy = 20 lat<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 miesi\u0119cy = 30 lat<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the schedule? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Potrzebujesz wi\u0119cej opcji, w tym mo\u017cliwo\u015bci rozwi\u0105zywania innych niewiadomych? Ustaw daty? Ustaw lub zmie\u0144 cz\u0119stotliwo\u015bci p\u0142atno\u015bci i kapitalizacji? Wydrukuj harmonogram? Eksportuj do plik\u00f3w MS Word&trade; (.docx) lub MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx)? Odwied\u017a, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Daty musz\u0105 by\u0107 pierwszym dniem miesi\u0105ca."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Nieprawid\u0142owy obiekt daty JavaScript."],"Monthly":["Miesi\u0119czny"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the charts? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Potrzebujesz wi\u0119cej opcji, w tym mo\u017cliwo\u015bci rozwi\u0105zywania innych niewiadomych? Ustaw daty? Ustaw lub zmie\u0144 cz\u0119stotliwo\u015bci p\u0142atno\u015bci i kapitalizacji? Wydrukuj wykresy? Eksportuj do plik\u00f3w MS Word&trade; (.docx) lub MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx)? Odwied\u017a, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Przygotowano dla"],"Address":["Adres"],"City, State  ZIP":["Miasto, woj., kod poczt."],"Prepared On":["Przygotowano dnia"],"Prepared by":["Przygotowane przez"],"Phone":["Telefon"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Strona internetowa"]}}}